# Visual Design System for GPT Web (ChatGPT Dark Theme Clone)

## CSS Variables (Root Level)
```css
:root {
  /* Color Palette */
  --color-bg-primary: #0d1117;
  --color-bg-secondary: #161b22;
  --color-bg-tertiary: #21262d;
  --color-bg-sidebar: #0d1117;

  --color-text-primary: #f0f6fc;
  --color-text-secondary: #8b949e;
  --color-text-tertiary: #6e7681;

  --color-border: #30363d;
  --color-border-light: #21262d;

  --color-accent-primary: #1f6feb;
  --color-accent-hover: #2a7de1;
  --color-accent-active: #0d419d;

  --color-message-user-bg: #1f6feb;
  --color-message-assistant-bg: #161b22;
  --color-message-border: #30363d;

  --color-code-bg: #0d1117;
  --color-code-border: #30363d;
  --color-code-text: #c9d1d9;

  --color-button-primary: #1f6feb;
  --color-button-hover: #2a7de1;
  --color-button-danger: #f85149;

  /* Typography */
  --font-family-primary: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
  --font-family-mono: 'SF Mono', Monaco, 'Cascadia Code', Consolas, monospace;

  --font-size-xs: 12px;
  --font-size-sm: 14px;
  --font-size-base: 16px;
  --font-size-lg: 18px;
  --font-size-xl: 20px;
  --font-size-2xl: 24px;

  --font-weight-normal: 400;
  --font-weight-medium: 500;
  --font-weight-semibold: 600;

  --line-height-tight: 1.25;
  --line-height-normal: 1.5;
  --line-height-relaxed: 1.75;
